{"id":"vod_bf_21321","vodId":"21321","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"萝球社第一季","name_cn":"萝球社第一季","date":"2011-01-01","year":"2011","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"完结","images":{"common":"https://p.bfvp26.com/upload/vod/20230424-22/8aa0fcfa6056d7734ea5a1f35ee93d44.jpg"},"summary":"由于一次意外，篮球健将长谷川昂（梶裕贵 配音）所隶属的篮球部被暂停活动一年。失去了最心爱的篮球，小昂的生活开始浑浑噩噩起来。经过阿姨篁美星（伊藤静 配音）的介绍，失意的小昂成为了私立慧心学园小学部的篮球教练。当小学部的篮球教练有什么意思？！虽然心有抵触，但小昂还是上岗了。　　经过了一段时间的训练，小昂曾经瞧不起的女子篮球队居然爆发出了惊人的势力。稳重大气的凑智花（花泽香菜 配音），活泼可爱的三沢真帆（井口裕香 配音），个性爽朗的永冢纱季（日笠阳子 配音），别看她们的身板单薄，但各个都有着出人意料的长项。小昂对于篮球的热情被重新激起了，他们的目标是——向县篮球大赛冠军进发！","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2026-06-10 01:36:32","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/luoqiushediyiji/第01集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/luoqiushediyiji/第02集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/luoqiushediyiji/第03集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/luoqiushediyiji/第04集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/luoqiushediyiji/第05集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/luoqiushediyiji/第06集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/luoqiushediyiji/第07集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/luoqiushediyiji/第08集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/luoqiushediyiji/第09集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/luoqiushediyiji/第10集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/luoqiushediyiji/第11集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/luoqiushediyiji/第12集/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T09:36:10.603Z"}